        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a quirky little world where fun fishkeeping and cozy moments swim together in perfect harmony!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/1a53f9343720e114977ea37bf07aca9b.avif?t=1762449716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras_big/1a53f9343720e114977ea37bf07aca9b.webp?t=1762449716 width=1600 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My Cozy Aquarium</i> combines the relaxing pace of idle gameplay with cozy, comforting mechanics, offering a serene space to unwind while feeding fish, decorating tanks, and watching your underwater world come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/7947ff0100320d1958eb7398b0a70796.avif?t=1762449716\" width=680 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your peaceful journey with one of four delightful aquariums, gradually unlocking the other three and building on the charming underwater worlds. Each aquarium introduces a unique theme and captivating fish species waiting to become your new aquatic friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/59721dbf4024989664bdd8ed39f046d8.avif?t=1762449716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras_big/59721dbf4024989664bdd8ed39f046d8.webp?t=1762449716 width=1600 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase surprise packs filled with delightful fish companions and nurture them through immersive, relaxing mini-games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/55fc8e4ab4df379d9f8af3b1583b29f1.avif?t=1762449716\" width=680 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your fish with care, maintain the perfect water temperature, clean the air filters to ensure healthy conditions, and gently scrub aquarium walls to keep your aquatic heaven crystal clear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/048aa425d6a6fbaa654bd9513eaa65e3.avif?t=1762449716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras_big/048aa425d6a6fbaa654bd9513eaa65e3.webp?t=1762449716 width=1600 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your fish grow, you'll experience the joy of raising them from tiny swimmers into magnificent adults. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/d26e507a95a8c438b5c605f830e6bb35.avif?t=1762449716\" width=680 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your matured fish to earn coins, enabling you to expand your underwater paradise further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/ed2b57eef6c49699a810c445c7a7ad51.avif?t=1762449716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras_big/ed2b57eef6c49699a810c445c7a7ad51.webp?t=1762449716 width=1600 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect over <strong>320 beautifully</strong> quirky fish species – each with charming and whimsical designs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/b211b571d6e527a3b1dacd9cfe7adb93.avif?t=1762449716\" width=680 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your aquariums with vibrant decorations and upgraded fish food, unlocking even more cozy, aesthetic possibilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/5c30d98961409e308e3fd67e54f0b317.avif?t=1762449716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras_big/5c30d98961409e308e3fd67e54f0b317.webp?t=1762449716 width=1600 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each out of the four fins tanks will offer different fish packages, inspired by real life fish but with a magical twist on them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/2f8f161f4c6272d9d17563b79ffa1208.avif?t=1762449716\" width=680 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aquariums Emerald Ripple, Coralspire Reef, Frozen, Abyss, and Magic Cove all have their unique set of fish for players to unlock and nurture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/44d29fbe344b3f7a95a690c200526efa.avif?t=1762449716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras_big/44d29fbe344b3f7a95a690c200526efa.webp?t=1762449716 width=1600 height=182 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinctly themed aquariums, each offering unique fish varieties and water environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and playful mini-games to nurture your fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 320 charmingly designed fish to collect - so many friends to get on well with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of colorful decorations and delightful touches to create an underwater paradise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle, cozy gameplay designed for relaxation, collection, and endless enjoyment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/47a81cbb27583a63b4fd369bed3f0943.avif?t=1762449716\" width=680 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Immerse yourself in an ideal underwater escape - but try not to get carried away by the current!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/ffec4726afe6050bf8dc7e1141330823.avif?t=1762449716\" width=680 height=300 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a quirky little world where fun fishkeeping and cozy moments swim together in perfect harmony!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/1a53f9343720e114977ea37bf07aca9b.avif?t=1762449716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras_big/1a53f9343720e114977ea37bf07aca9b.webp?t=1762449716 width=1600 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My Cozy Aquarium</i> combines the relaxing pace of idle gameplay with cozy, comforting mechanics, offering a serene space to unwind while feeding fish, decorating tanks, and watching your underwater world come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/7947ff0100320d1958eb7398b0a70796.avif?t=1762449716\" width=680 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your peaceful journey with one of four delightful aquariums, gradually unlocking the other three and building on the charming underwater worlds. Each aquarium introduces a unique theme and captivating fish species waiting to become your new aquatic friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras/59721dbf4024989664bdd8ed39f046d8.avif?t=1762449716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757170/extras_big/59721dbf4024989664bdd8ed39f046d8.webp?t=1762449716 width=1600 height=182 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase surprise packs filled with delightful fish companions and nurture them through immersive, relaxing mini-games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><